Sound files in this directory (excluded from the project's MIT license)

driver_chatter/, passenger_chatter/
  Synthetic speech generated for this project from the lines in
  assets/driver_chatter.json and assets/passenger_chatter.json, with text-to-
  speech tools (Microsoft Azure Speech via utils/ttsazure.py, and Chatterbox
  Multilingual TTS in the separate ai-audio-studio project).

  Status: UNRESOLVED. Which tool, voice and reference recording produced each
  file is not recorded, so the terms that apply to each file are not yet
  established. See LICENSE_AUDIT.md (sound section) before redistributing.

The police siren recording that this file used to list was removed from the
game; nothing else in this directory comes from a third party.
